From: Fleurs Nix configuration
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the managed PAM processing acknowledgement on oo7 0.7.1

The deployed managed PAM module waits for one byte: zero after successful
processing, nonzero on failure. Replace the upstream framed response with
that protocol and propagate write errors. Upstream already removed the
listener-clone Drop which unlinked the shared socket; do not reapply it.

